  "entry": "code/hedweb/runserver.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Web forms where you upload event tables, JSON sidecars, tagging spreadsheets, HED strings or HED schemas, pick a HED schema version, and get back validation reports, assembled per-event annotations, query results, converted tags or sidecar templates. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
